# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# prefs: factory
# Folding, end to end: the box beside a line that opens a block folds the
# block away, the lines after it move up, and the box unfolds it again;
# Text > Fold folds the block the caret is in.  The first pixel is a
# glyph pixel of the second row's text, one(); while the block is shown;
# the second is the upright of the plus the box shows while it is folded.
wait 25
click 980 30
wait 4
menu-pick Documents
wait 4
menu-pick Editor
wait 90
expect-title Edit
click 60 8
wait 6
menu-pick Open…
wait 40
expect-title Open
click 400 200
wait 6
click 675 413
wait 60
expect-no-title Open
click-window Edit
wait 25
shot /tmp/tiku-editor-fold-open.png
note unfolded, the second row holds one(); and the box a minus
expect-pixel 291 167 080808
expect-pixel 245 149 ffffff
click 245 151
wait 25
shot /tmp/tiku-editor-fold-folded.png
note folded, the second row holds the closing brace and the box a plus
expect-pixel 291 167 ffffff
expect-pixel 245 149 7f7f7f
click 245 151
wait 25
note unfolded again
expect-pixel 291 167 080808
expect-pixel 245 149 ffffff
click 300 170
wait 6
click 256 8
wait 6
expect-menu Fold
menu-pick Fold
wait 25
shot /tmp/tiku-editor-fold-menu.png
note Text > Fold with the caret in the block folds it
expect-pixel 291 167 ffffff
expect-pixel 245 149 7f7f7f
quit
